      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U02_L06_Q18</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Unit 2 application support</p><p>A student solves 7x + 3 = 31 and says the answer is 31. What is the mistake?</p>]]></text>
