    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U02_L06_Q20</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Unit 2 application support</p><p>Which statement best describes a constraint in a real-world equation problem?</p>]]></text>
